'''Paranormal Activity''' (百鬼夜行, ''Hyakkiyakō'', '''Paranormal Activity''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 2150.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (M): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +2.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Paranormal Activity|Worker Start Level Up (M)|Wheel Cat|Vengeful Cat|Evil Cat|jpname=百鬼夜行}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo may be a reference to the horror movie series of the same name.
*[[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]] is here because he's based on [[wikipedia:Wanyūdō|wanyūdō]], a ''yōkai'' that appears as the head of a tormented man trapped within a burning oxcart wheel.

